DESCRIPTION:Duration: 113 mins (1h53m)\n\nBrace yourself for a totally new
  experience in cutting-edge animation. Based on the classic comic created 
 by Osamu Tezuka (Astro Boy)\, written by Japanese anime legend Katsuhiro O
 tomo (Akira) and directed by Rintaro (Galaxy Express 999)\, Metropolis is 
 a spectacular film featuring stunning imagery and unforgettable characters
 . In it\, a detective and his sidekick discover a duke's plot to control 
 the world via a humanlike robot.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-even
 ts/ani-marathon/osamu-tezukas-metropolis\n\nEstimated start: 12:45
